  into the enclosure as a means of Escape  further suggestions put forward for the  matter include using microwave emitters  to remotely heat the interior of the  unit and the use of high volume high  intensity Sonic equipment proven to  inhabit concentration staff is also  instructed to assist in this effort by  channeling positive thoughts  incorporating the demise and destruction  of  scp-1447-1 positive slogans are posted  in the hallways and break rooms around  the facility to assist in positive  thinking weekly therapy visits for all  staff members are mandatory to ensure an  environment of strong mental health and  complementary gym memberships are given  out to employees to promote physical  well-being and motivated thinking in the  only interview on file with the human  known as  scp-1447-2 Steve Dr rolfus asked the  subject what would happen if the tulpa  were allowed to kill him  scp-1447-2 refused to answer leaving  Foundation and researchers to arrive at  two possible theories first if  scp-1447-1 destroys the human that is  responsible for its existence then  surely it too will cease to exist though  when researchers tested this Theory by  inflicting different levels of fiscal  pain to  scp-1447-2 the toppa appeared to have no  effect or change in its Behavior the  second theory and the one with a greater  support of evidence is that if the tulpa  kills  scp-1447-2 and it has already  demonstrated that it has the ability to  meditate on its own existence than its  behavior from then on out is entirely  impossible to predict at the moment its  fixation on  scp-1447-2 has been a large contributing  factor to the facility's ability to  contain it if it were to decide that its  new purpose was to bring its version of  peace to every life on the planet there  would be little the foundation could do  to stop it that outcome must be avoided  at all costs and by extension the life  of the human known as  scp-1447-2 must be protected so  hopefully you never had an imaginary  friend manifest itself into existence  and tried to kill you but what we can  all agree on is that some things are  better left in our forgotten childhood  memories now go check out  scp-5254 gotta catch em all and scp-6080  Cartoon Network for more childhood  Terrors made real

